{
 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 1,
   "end": 3.253583,
   "text": "AI can help you write code faster."
  },
  {
   "start": 4.0305420000000005,
   "end": 7.032040859813084,
   "text": "But when something changes, how do you know what happened,"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.072040859813084,
   "end": 9.891583,
   "text": "what it affects, and whether it's ready to ship?"
  },
  {
   "start": 11.2,
   "end": 12.672125,
   "text": "Meet FailSafe."
  },
  {
   "start": 13.444167,
   "end": 17.72975424832215,
   "text": "A development companion that helps solo developers keep their work visible,"
  },
  {
   "start": 17.769754248322148,
   "end": 22.287667,
   "text": "understand potential risks, and maintain a record of important decisions."
  },
  {
   "start": 23.2,
   "end": 25.253458,
   "text": "Setup starts in the Console."
  },
  {
   "start": 26.083042,
   "end": 27.90306061797753,
   "text": "Install the Qor-Logic skills,"
  },
  {
   "start": 27.94306061797753,
   "end": 32.041375,
   "text": "approve the request in VS Code, and the workspace is ready."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.7,
   "end": 37.151622191489366,
   "text": "With version 6.0.12, the Console, Monitor,"
  },
  {
   "start": 37.191622191489365,
   "end": 41.764583,
   "text": "and SRE views share a consistent visual experience."
  },
  {
   "start": 42.505458000000004,
   "end": 45.265292,
   "text": "Change your theme, and your workspace follows."
  },
  {
   "start": 46.16054200000001,
   "end": 49.335083000000004,
   "text": "The information stays familiar, wherever you're working."
  },
  {
   "start": 51.1,
   "end": 53.75775,
   "text": "Now imagine a small but important bug."
  },
  {
   "start": 54.492583,
   "end": 57.649583,
   "text": "A date validator accepts a day that doesn't exist."
  },
  {
   "start": 58.324917,
   "end": 63.723333000000004,
   "text": "We document the issue, write a regression test, and see the failure for ourselves."
  },
  {
   "start": 65.1,
   "end": 67.384,
   "text": "Fixing the code is only part of the job."
  },
  {
   "start": 68.15104199999999,
   "end": 72.38940442968749,
   "text": "FailSafe helps surface the risks and governance requirements around a change,"
  },
  {
   "start": 72.4294044296875,
   "end": 75.513125,
   "text": "so the developer knows what still needs attention."
  },
  {
   "start": 76.5,
   "end": 79.397458,
   "text": "The corrected validator passes its tests."
  },
  {
   "start": 80.162375,
   "end": 83.45531854385965,
   "text": "We can inspect the difference, see the recorded decisions,"
  },
  {
   "start": 83.49531854385965,
   "end": 86.963333,
   "text": "and compare the result with what we intended to change."
  },
  {
   "start": 87.7,
   "end": 89.52279200000001,
   "text": "Every change has a story."
  },
  {
   "start": 90.25883300000001,
   "end": 95.854292,
   "text": "What we set out to do, what we changed, what we checked, and what still needs review."
  },
  {
   "start": 96.5875,
   "end": 99.771167,
   "text": "FailSafe helps make that story easier to follow."
  },
  {
   "start": 100.4,
   "end": 103.149,
   "text": "Move faster without losing sight of the work."
  },
  {
   "start": 103.905708,
   "end": 104.74275,
   "text": "FailSafe."
  },
  {
   "start": 105.51462500000001,
   "end": 106.90112500000001,
   "text": "Build with AI."
  },
  {
   "start": 107.60608300000001,
   "end": 108.748833,
   "text": "Know what changed."
  }
 ],
